# Tooling

- Use JDK 17, Gradle 9.3+, and Android SDK API 37.
- Run `gradle test lint assembleDebug` before finishing.
- Generate a wrapper only with a trusted Gradle installation; commit all
  generated wrapper files together.
- Use Android Studio for Compose previews and emulator/device runs.
- Never commit `local.properties`, build output, or IDE user state.
